T(N) = \frac{1}{N+1} \left( \frac{N(N+1)}{2} \right)^2
T(N) = \frac{1}{N+1} \frac{N^2(N+1)^2}{4}
T(N) = \frac{N^2(N+1)}{4}

This can be rewritten as:
T(N) = \frac{N^3 + N^2}{4}

